00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:06.506 align:start size:94% position:6%
This first one's
from @StevecarlsonWF.

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:08.541 align:start size:94% position:6%
He says, "I nervously asked
the girl I liked,

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:09.743 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Do you want to go
to homecoming?'

00:00:09.743 --> 00:00:11.244 align:start size:94% position:6%
When she said yes,
I was still so nervous

00:00:11.244 --> 00:00:14.381
that for some reason, I blurted
out, 'Cool. With who?'"

00:00:14.381 --> 00:00:19.452 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:20.553 line:92%
"I-I-I'm just doing a survey.

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:22.455 align:start size:94% position:6%
I want to know
who's going with who."

00:00:22.455 --> 00:00:25.158 line:92%
This one's from @boobearmelly.

00:00:25.158 --> 00:00:27.927
She says, "Nelly's song
'Get Your Eagle On' was playing.

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:30.797
I dropped down so low,
my pants split down the middle.

00:00:30.797 --> 00:00:32.599 align:start size:94% position:6%
All my friends
had to huddle around me

00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:34.300 line:92%
and dance me out of the gym."

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.536 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:39.072 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:39.072 --> 00:00:42.108 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, that's what
friends are for, man.

00:00:42.108 --> 00:00:43.877 line:92%
That's what friends are for.

00:00:43.877 --> 00:00:45.945 line:92%
